{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194890/extras/logo_600.png?t=1742554585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Birdfull is a small relaxing idle game. Attract birds with feed, try to keep them longer, and discover all of them including the unique ones! Watch the birds, generate more eggs in real time, and customize your cozy bird space. Try spotting all the birds of the American backyard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194890/extras/hungry_1080.gif?t=1742554585\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect birds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed the birds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade feed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build facilities and decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offline progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute birds!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194890/extras/sparrow_600_111.png?t=1742554585\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">== Special features ==</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form loving couples and get more valuable eggs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Birds won't stay forever unless you keep them fed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build special facilities to keep birds longer or forever even</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your backyard and increase your chances to see rare birds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock achievements to find special kinds of birds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't sell birds -they are free creatures!<